{"id":"bc8a45866957835d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-p-samplable-distribution.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Samplable Ensembles","display":"df-p-samplable-distribution — Polynomial-Time Samplable Ensembles","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-p-samplable-distribution","aliases":["28-df-p-samplable-distribution"],"display":"df-p-samplable-distribution — Polynomial-Time Samplable Ensembles","depends_on":["[[28-df-distributional-problem]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §18.2","source_printed_pages":"365","source_pdf_pages":"391","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"definition-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-p-samplable-distribution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-p-samplable-distribution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p-samplable-distribution — Polynomial-Time Samplable Ensembles"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" href=\"?note=d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" title=\"28-df-distributional-problem\">28-df-distributional-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §18.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"365"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"391"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathfrak D\">\\(D\\in\\mathfrak D\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" href=\"?note=d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" title=\"28-df-distributional-problem\">28-df-distributional-problem</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(1^n,r)\">\\(S(1^n,r)\\)</span> 为确定型函数在配对输入的输出，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 为均匀p(n)位随机串；本条采用严格最坏时间、有限公平随机位的精确采样版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PSamp}(D)\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ \\exists S\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad D_n(x)=2^{-p(n)}|\\{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(n)}:S(1^n,r)=x\\}|\\land\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(n)}\\ |S(1^n,r)|=n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PSamp}(D)\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ \\exists S\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad D_n(x)=2^{-p(n)}|\\{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(n)}:S(1^n,r)=x\\}|\\land\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(n)}\\ |S(1^n,r)|=n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限公平随机带可以通过补读随机位统一长度。此版本精确概率为二进有理数；教材称P-computable蕴含P-samplable时没有展开随机采样模型，对任意有理概率若要求严格最坏多项式时间与精确公平位采样，需额外约定。因此本条不写该无条件蕴含，避免将精确采样与近似或期望时间混同。</p>\n<p>来源：§18.2；印刷页 365；PDF 页 391。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第18章的 Polynomial-Time Samplable Ensembles，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-distributional-problem","status":"resolved","id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-distributional-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-distributional-problem","status":"resolved","id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathfrak D$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]，$p\\in\\mathbb N[t]$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathfrak D$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]，$p\\in\\mathbb N[t]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D\\in\\mathfrak D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb N[t]","display":false},{"tex":"S(1^n,r)","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PSamp}(D)\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ \\exists S\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad D_n(x)=2^{-p(n)}|\\{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(n)}:S(1^n,r)=x\\}|\\land\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(n)}\\ |S(1^n,r)|=n.","display":true}],"bytes":2010,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-367","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-p-computable-distribution]]、[[28-df-p-samplable-distribution]]、[[28-df-distributional-levin-reduction]]、[[28-df-distnp]]、[[28-df-distributional-bounded-halting]]、[[28-thm-levin-distnp-completeness]]。"}],"outgoing":["d4b3c83a7ffb542c","adb92775ec020a0b"]}